    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d144">

                <pb facs="0329" n="241" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg241"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/2733: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Norweb</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-01-04T21:00:00-04:00">January 4, 1933—9
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received January 4—8:46 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>4. Department’s No. 3, January 4, 11 a.m.<anchor n="3a" xml:id="d144-f1"/> In two
                    conversations with the Minister for Foreign Affairs he has reiterated that he
                    has <pb facs="0330" n="242" xml:id="pg242"/> reached no conclusion.
                    Conversations with interested colleagues confirm this but suggest that he is
                    awaiting some indication from the Argentine. Have appointment with him
                    tomorrow.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Norweb</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
